# Findings scripts/check-docs.sh accepts: `<finding key or whole doc path>  # <reason>`, one per line.
# The list only shrinks: fix a finding and delete its line (a stale line fails --strict).
# Only L02-governance edits this file; other lanes fix the doc or hand the text in.

